MODULE: CoreStepRefinedRearmKeepsLead
TARGET: CoreStepRefined
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the witness pass rearm keeps the previous pass lead
PERTURBS: PassRearm

--- FIND
    /\ leadDone' = FALSE
    /\ rank' = RankForPass
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: a new pass inherits the old lead.
    /\ leadDone' = leadDone
    /\ rank' = RankForPass
--- END
